# Unity C# Scripts Standards

## Cấu trúc script

```csharp
using UnityEngine;

namespace BeautyScrewJam.Core
{
    public class PlayerController : MonoBehaviour
    {
        #region Fields
        [Header("Movement")]
        [SerializeField] private float moveSpeed = 5f;
        
        private bool m_isGrounded;  // m_ prefix cho private non-serialized
        #endregion

        #region Unity Lifecycle
        private void Awake() { /* Init components */ }
        private void Start() { /* Setup state */ }
        private void Update() { /* Input */ }
        private void FixedUpdate() { /* Physics */ }
        #endregion

        #region Public Methods
        public void Jump() { /* ... */ }
        #endregion

        #region Private Methods
        private void HandleInput() { /* ... */ }
        #endregion
    }
}
```

## Quy tắc đặt tên

- **Classes/Interfaces**: `PascalCase`, `IPascalCase`
- **Methods**: `PascalCase` (public & private)
- **Properties**: `PascalCase`
- **Fields (SerializeField)**: `camelCase`
- **Fields (private)**: `m_camelCase`
- **Constants**: `UPPER_CASE`
- **Local vars**: `camelCase`

## Performance

**Cache references:**
```csharp
// ❌ Tìm mỗi frame
void Update() {
    GameObject.Find("Player").DoSomething();
}

// ✅ Cache trong Start
private GameObject m_player;
void Start() { m_player = GameObject.Find("Player"); }
void Update() { m_player.DoSomething(); }
```

**Reuse objects:**
```csharp
// ❌ Tạo mới mỗi frame
void Update() {
    Vector3 pos = new Vector3(1, 2, 3);
}

// ✅ Reuse
private Vector3 m_pos = new Vector3();
void Update() {
    m_pos.Set(1, 2, 3);
}
```

**Object Pooling:**
```csharp
public class ObjectPool : MonoBehaviour {
    private Queue<GameObject> pool = new Queue<GameObject>();
    
    public GameObject Get() {
        if (pool.Count > 0) {
            var obj = pool.Dequeue();
            obj.SetActive(true);
            return obj;
        }
        return Instantiate(prefab);
    }
    
    public void Return(GameObject obj) {
        obj.SetActive(false);
        pool.Enqueue(obj);
    }
}
```

## NO FALLBACK - Quy tắc vàng

**TUYỆT ĐỐI KHÔNG thêm fallback logic khi fix bug/add feature/refactor.**

### ❌ CẤMI Fallback

```csharp
// ❌ Fallback với default value
public void SetLevel(int level) {
    m_level = level > 0 ? level : 1;  // Che giấu lỗi!
}

// ❌ Fallback với null coalescing
public Item GetItem(int id) {
    return database?.Get(id) ?? CreateDefault();  // Che giấu lỗi!
}

// ❌ Silent catch
try { SaveGame(); }
catch { Debug.Log("Save failed"); }  // Che giấu lỗi!

// ❌ Lazy init fallback
public void Play(AudioClip clip) {
    if (audioSource == null)
        audioSource = gameObject.AddComponent<AudioSource>();  // Che giấu lỗi!
}
```

### ✅ ĐÚNG - Fail Fast

```csharp
// ✅ Validate input
public void SetLevel(int level) {
    if (level <= 0)
        throw new ArgumentException($"Level must be > 0, got {level}");
    m_level = level;
}

// ✅ Validate state
public Item GetItem(int id) {
    if (database == null)
        throw new NullReferenceException("Database not initialized");
    Item item = database.Get(id);
    if (item == null)
        throw new InvalidOperationException($"Item {id} not found");
    return item;
}

// ✅ Throw exception
try { SaveGame(); }
catch (IOException ex) {
    throw new InvalidOperationException("Failed to save", ex);
}

// ✅ Validate in Awake
private void Awake() {
    audioSource = GetComponent<AudioSource>();
    if (audioSource == null)
        throw new InvalidOperationException("AudioSource required");
}
```

### Tại sao không dùng fallback?

1. **Che giấu lỗi** → Khó debug
2. **Logic phức tạp** → Khó maintain
3. **Dữ liệu không nhất quán** → Gây lỗi cascade
4. **Khó tìm root cause** → Mất thời gian

### Khi nào được phép fallback?

✅ **Chỉ được phép trong:**
- Infrastructure layer (logging, cache)
- UI/UX layer (default theme, missing texture)
- Editor tools

❌ **CẤMI trong:**
- Game logic (movement, combat, progression)
- Data validation
- Core systems (inventory, save/load)

## Checklist trước khi refactor

- [ ] Kiểm tra usage (IDE search, code map)
- [ ] Cảnh báo side effects
- [ ] Xóa bỏ code cũ hoàn toàn (không giữ "backup")
- [ ] Refactor toàn bộ call sites (không backward compatibility)
- [ ] Viết/update tests

## Best Practices

1. **Null checks**: Validate trong `Awake`/`Start`
2. **Component caching**: Cache trong `Awake`
3. **Event unsubscribe**: Trong `OnDestroy`
4. **Coroutines**: Dùng flags để tránh duplicate
5. **No fallback**: Fail fast, throw exception rõ ràng
